OL,3,GNEWSAColourful junction still dividing
OL,4,Aopinion two years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo years after a junction underwent a
OL,7,Fcolourful #5.5m makeover, people's
OL,8,Fopinions towards it remain mixed.
OL,10,FDetractors said California Crossroads
OL,11,Fin Finchampstead, Berkshire, looked
OL,12,Funclear following Wokingham Borough
OL,13,FCouncil's project and was an "accident
OL,14,Fwaiting to happen".
OL,16,FBut the council's Adrian Betteridge
OL,17,Fsaid it had achieved all that the
OL,18,Fauthority set out to since work was
OL,19,Fcompleted in September 2024.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
